B.ac8=s(["Private cloud backup is separate from publication. Only explicitly submitted works enter review and become public after approval and publication.","For GLB publication, 26 rendered views of the final model, together with its title and description, are submitted to Aliyun text/image moderation. These views are not original capture photos. Unsupported formats cannot be automatically published through this route.","Risk may require human review; prohibited content is rejected; errors or incomplete results do not automatically publish. Changed content requires a new review. Publication does not waive privacy or other people's rights.","Titles are limited to 100 characters; descriptions to 30.","Content prohibited by law may not be published.","Obtain consent from people appearing in a scene before publishing it publicly.","Exported 3D model files carry a provenance marker, as required by Chinese regulations on deep synthesis services. It does not affect normal use of the file."],t.s)
